													"text" : "This device is similar to the Pitch & Echo device, except that we've separated the stereo echo effect into two independant mono delay lines, so that each audio channel can be treated separately. We've also added some transport-relative timing control of the delay times, thus allowing some more interesting polyrhythmic echo effects."
